umOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"994240868340191232","date":1525880469000,"rawContent":"The youngest of the three of us then tells a recent story of men coming up to her in public, when she's carrying shopping, and pushing for her number. \n\nShe's beautiful, that's not the issue here. These men are identifying women they perceive are least likely to resist. #metoo","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":92,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"994276622726565889","date":1525888994000,"rawContent":"@amandahess Kevin Spacey, who assaulted men and boys, is mentioned in this list. Murphy isn't above critique but the gay male experience in #MeToo is not being given it's due.","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":92,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":25,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"994277239217950725","date":1525889141000,"rawContent":"Gay men have a place in #MeToo. Straight men have a place in #MeToo. These predatory #Hollywood men didn't only target vagina-havers.","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":92,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":26,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatt