PerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":93,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":31,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1029774039940771842","date":1534352238000,"rawContent":"False abuse allegations happen. The #MeToo movement is about justice denied, not mob justice.","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":93,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":32,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1032248930631929856","date":1534942297000,"rawContent":"Asia might be innocent of the charges, but I'm happy with the way #MeToo leaders accepted the possible veracity of the story and their mature response","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":93,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":33,"sumOfClimate":40,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1034470374711484416","date":1535471931000,"rawContent":"Re: #LouisCK \"coming back\"...\n\nPunishment isn't really the thing #MeToo should be striving for, but restorative justice. I don't know what his plan is, but he has to actively rebuild his trust with the industry and with the public. And that, ladies and gents, takes years.","userId":41024022,"media":null,"username":"TheOdalisque","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":93,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":2,"sumOfMeToo":34,"